us Reward Miles based on the Miles earned from the flight.</li>\n    <li>This offer is valid only for AlFursan members who complete their booking within the specified booking period and travel during the defined travel period.</li>\n    <li>The travel period to earn the Bonus Reward Miles is from 23 September 2026 to 31 December 2026.</li>\n    <li>This offer applies to bookings made between 16 September 2026 and 30 September 2026.</li>\n    <li>Bonus Reward Miles are available to AlFursan members only.</li>\n    <li>Terms and conditions specific to AlFursan Program apply.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div></span><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></app-jss-about-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper similar-offers-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">More offers for you</h2><!----><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}